1
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:02,836
You declined her call again.

2
00:00:04,186 --> 00:00:05,834
"I'll call her back later."

3
00:00:07,484 --> 00:00:09,596
Remember when they were your whole world?

4
00:00:11,646 --> 00:00:13,862
She ran behind you... so you wouldn't fall.

5
00:00:16,112 --> 00:00:17,052
Then you grew up.

6
00:00:17,602 --> 00:00:19,017
And they became... annoying.

7
00:00:21,467 --> 00:00:23,150
She still cooks for two.

8
00:00:23,700 --> 00:00:25,220
Just in case you visit.

9
00:00:27,870 --> 00:00:29,378
His hands shake now.

10
00:00:29,828 --> 00:00:30,907
He won't tell you.

11
00:00:33,457 --> 00:00:34,768
You think you have time.

12
00:00:35,418 --> 00:00:37,693
You see them maybe five times a year.

13
00:00:39,143 --> 00:00:40,941
If they live twenty more years...

14
00:00:41,591 --> 00:00:43,285
that's one hundred visits.

15
00:00:43,935 --> 00:00:44,445
Left.

16
00:00:47,695 --> 00:00:49,877
One day... the phone will stop ringing.

17
00:00:53,027 --> 00:00:54,257
So call her.

18
00:00:57,907 --> 00:01:03,296
Hello? Sweetheart? Is everything okay?

19
00:01:05,146 --> 00:01:06,608
Not because you have to.

20
00:01:07,758 --> 00:01:09,998
Because one day... you won't be able to.

21
00:01:12,048 --> 00:01:13,730
They gave you their whole life.

22
00:01:14,280 --> 00:01:15,417
Give them an hour.

23
00:01:22,267 --> 00:01:23,253
Call them today.

